cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "SuperconducTED noise engine"
abstract: >-
  A fuzzy-logic noise engine for Qiskit Aer. It turns IBM calibration
  snapshots into an ensemble of noise models through a Takagi-Sugeno-Kang
  fuzzy inference layer, aiming for interval-valued simulation output that
  tracks real hardware across calibration cycles. Research preview.
